Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.11,0:00:03.28,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.39,0:00:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡骑士 他会出现在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death … he's gonna be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.51,0:00:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你要这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand you want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.18,0:00:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有条件的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.68,0:00:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你骗不了死亡骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you can't cheat death.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.37,0:00:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得它不是在杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think it's killing people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.90,0:00:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是在人们大限将近时 带走他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's taking them when their time is just up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}A reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比我上次见到的那个死神可美多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're much prettier than the last reaper I met.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.88,0:00:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是上次来找你的那个死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this is the reaper that came after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.54,0:00:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 苔莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean. - Tessa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.25,0:00:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 巴尔萨泽 - 为什么你要买下人的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Balthazar. - Why you buying up human souls?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.21,0:00:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道灵魂价值几何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea what souls are worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.27,0:00:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,又拥有多么强大的能量吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What power they hold?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.82,0:00:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是想确定 关于要回你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just making sure that you're not having second thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.46,0:00:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有半点犹豫\N{\fnArial\fs30}about getting your soul back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.21,0:00:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆的灵魂和米迦勒还有路西法一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's soul has been locked in the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.87,0:00:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,被关在笼子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}with Michael and Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.04,0:00:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们强行\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we try to force.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.15,0:00:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那个残废的东西塞到萨姆体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}that mutilated thing down Sam's gullet,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.63,0:00:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果可能会非常惨烈\N{\fnArial\fs30}it could be catastrophic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.17,0:00:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要自己的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.32,0:00:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把它弄回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we get it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.55,0:00:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果出现什么复杂情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if there are complications,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.70,0:00:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再想办法处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we will figure out a way to deal with those, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.67,0:00:56.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.65,0:01:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.68,0:01:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在 找…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, I'm, uh, looking for…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.66,0:01:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,沿这条路到后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow all the way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.23,0:01:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,到后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.20,0:01:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean Winchester?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.86,0:02:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定就是罗伯特博士了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be Dr. Robert?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.60,0:02:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 给你父亲缝伤口的次数我都数不清了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son, I stitched up your daddy more times than I can count,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.48,0:02:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.76,0:02:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.64,0:02:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然这都是很久以前的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course that was ages ago, go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.91,0:02:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时候我还有行医执照呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I still have my medical lisence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.16,0:02:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.34,0:02:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, I'm, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.46,0:02:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没洁癖 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm no germ freak, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.99,0:02:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里租金便宜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rent's cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.32,0:02:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊娃 我的助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eva, my assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.66,0:02:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,躺这边来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hop right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.49,0:02:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你做这个很多次了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}N-now, you … you have, uh, done this a lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.34,0:02:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是相当多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, many, many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.97,0:02:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你的… 成功率是多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your…Success rate?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.20,0:02:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,相当出色 差不多有75%\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, excellent … almost 75%.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.94,0:02:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我们先做好准备工作如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, should we get the, uh, preliminaries out of the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.64,0:02:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Uh, yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.51,0:03:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.35,0:03:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 万一…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, if, uh, something…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.27,0:03:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goes wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.94,0:03:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.25,0:03:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮我寄这封信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you mail this for me, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.26,0:03:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.33,0:03:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你有东西要留给弟弟萨姆呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would've thought you had something for your brother, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.87,0:03:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不能回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don't make it back,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.31,0:03:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说什么对他来说都是瞎扯淡\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing I say is gonna mean a damn thing to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.04,0:03:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,傲娇个啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.63,0:03:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,对病人好点会死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, a little bedside manner would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.43,0:03:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we ready? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.57,0:03:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有三分钟的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.89,0:04:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有脉搏 没有窦性心律\N{\fnArial\fs30}No pulse, no sinus rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.28,0:04:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.95,0:04:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,真开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.90,0:04:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好能行得通\N{\fnArial\fs30}This better work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.54,0:04:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.69,0:04:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.06,0:04:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.38,0:04:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我勒个去 还真管用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know? It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.10,0:04:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚正在苏丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in the Sudan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.29,0:04:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你召唤我过来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with yanking me ov…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.65,0:04:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 你怎么会死 - 苔莎 帮个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, why are you dead? - Tessa, I need a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.61,0:04:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑 你挂掉就为找我帮…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're kidding. You died to ask me …
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.05,0:04:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟你老大说我要跟他聊聊 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell your boss I need to talk to him. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.54,0:04:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求你了 - 你胆子怎么这么大\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please? - Where do you get the nerve?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.85,0:04:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常时期嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Desperate times.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.97,0:05:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有他召唤我们的份 我们无法召唤他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He calls us. We don't call him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.03,0:05:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你就破例一次 - 我办不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You make an exception! - I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.57,0:05:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不能还是不想 - 都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can't or won't?! - Both!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.39,0:05:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 苔莎 非常感谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Tessa. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.41,0:05:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.55,0:05:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第6季第11集]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.69,0:05:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很忙的 迪恩 有话快说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm busy, Dean. Talk fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.90,0:05:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我手上有属于你的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have something of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.91,0:05:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是指我的戒指吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean my ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.20,0:05:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得是暂时借给你而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I recall loaning you that temporarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.39,0:05:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 如果你想要回它的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you want it back …
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.54,0:05:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你以为我不知道你将它藏在哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, you assume that I don't know where you've hidden it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.30,0:05:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,可算见识了刚愎自用却一无是处的你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we've established you have hubris but no leverage,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.92,0:05:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底想干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}what is it you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.53,0:05:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法的牢笼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer's cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.56,0:05:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是为数不多能够打开它的人之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figure you're one of the few people that can actually jailbreak it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.79,0:05:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.78,0:05:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆的灵魂被困在里面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's soul is stuck in that box.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.93,0:05:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我听说了 - 我们三弟也困在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've heard. - And our other brother is trapped in there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.72,0:05:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,米迦勒带他进去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael rode him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.73,0:06:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 有话快说有屁快放吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, quit shuffling and deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.65,0:06:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让你把他们都救出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to get 'em both out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.71,0:06:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能二选一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.72,0:06:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 要萨姆的灵魂还是亚当的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What?! - Sam's soul or Adam's.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.98,0:06:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是 - 照规矩 我不带人类回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But… - As a rule, I don't bring people back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.40,0:06:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能破例一次 绝不能有第二次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might make an exception once, not twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.31,0:06:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 选吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…Pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.81,0:06:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.15,0:06:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的灵魂已经在那儿呆了整整一年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His soul has been in there for a year,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.29,0:06:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道它已经…有损伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I understand that it's…damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.46,0:06:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那叫四分五裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try flayed to the raw nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.17,0:06:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有什么办法可以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, is there any way that you could, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.67,0:06:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,抹掉地狱所经历的那部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, hack the hell part off?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.68,0:06:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs30}4 3 2\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four, three, two…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.48,0:06:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.81,0:06:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.92,0:06:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 迪恩 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, Dean, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.39,0:07:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得灵魂是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think the soul is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.90,0:07:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个可以让你随便切的派吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some pie you can slice?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.14,0:07:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵魂可以被鞭笞折磨 但永不会破碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}The soul can be bludgeoned, tortured, but never broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.80,0:07:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是我也办不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.48,0:07:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一定还有其他办法吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's got to be something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.91,0:07:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.83,0:07:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,抹去那部分办不到 但我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't erase Sam's hell, but I can…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.56,0:07:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你愿意 我能将它隔离在屏障之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}put it behind a wall, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.94,0:07:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,屏障\N{\fnArial\fs30}A "Wall."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.77,0:07:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他大脑中一个抑制思绪潮涌的大坝\N{\fnArial\fs30}In his mind … a dam to hold back the tide.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.61,0:07:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些记忆可谓十分不愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nasty, those memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.73,0:07:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会想知道它们会怎样影响他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to know what they'll do to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.53,0:07:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.98,0:07:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 一个屏障 听起来好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, uh, a wall. Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.20,0:07:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那不是永久性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's not permanent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.84,0:07:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 没什么能持续到永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right. Nothing lasts forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.46,0:07:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的确是永生 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I do, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.10,0:07:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 现在有两个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so that's the choice …
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.13,0:07:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有灵魂的萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam with no soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.47,0:07:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是脑子里有墙的萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}or Sam with some drywall.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.11,0:07:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这面墙一旦倒塌\N{\fnArial\fs30}that if or when it collapses,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.08,0:07:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's…done?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.61,0:07:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.92,0:07:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.55,0:07:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未说过我会做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never said I'd do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.68,0:08:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们一直在讨论毛啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then what the hell have we been talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.19,0:08:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的奖励\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.54,0:08:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你赌赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you win the wager.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.43,0:08:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 赌什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. What's the bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.55,0:08:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别翻白眼 迪恩 很不礼貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't roll your eyes, Dean. It's impolite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.49,0:08:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的戒指拿来 戴上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, when you fetch my ring, put it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.53,0:08:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.39,0:08:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你扮演一天我的角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to be me for one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.12,0:08:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认真的么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.71,0:08:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我这是使劲儿吐槽呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm being incredibly sarcastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.91,0:08:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊娃 肾上腺素\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eva, adrenaline!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.37,0:08:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,24小时之内取下戒指的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the ring off before the 24 hours are up,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.30,0:08:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.78,0:08:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆就没灵魂了 清楚了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No soul for Sam. Clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.07,0:08:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.16,0:08:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 为什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.27,0:08:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单 迪恩 因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simple, Dean. Because …
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.18,0:08:52.90,Title,0,0,0,0,,感谢摩西（《圣经》中犹太人古代领袖）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank Moses.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.66,0:08:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能多让我死五秒钟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't have given me five more seconds?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.58,0:08:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 你死了七分钟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son, you were gone for seven minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.63,0:09:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.73,0:09:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你活不了了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought for sure Death had you by the twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.63,0:09:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你什么 - 听我说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You what?! - Just hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.78,0:09:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我听过小卡和克劳力说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard Cass and Crowley when they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.82,0:09:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要么死要么生不如死\N{\fnArial\fs30}it would either kill me or turn me to jello, Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.91,0:09:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.53,0:09:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 死亡说他能建一个屏障 - 屏障\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Death said he can put up a wall. - A wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.61,0:09:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对对 屏障 就是基本上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes, a wall … that … that, basically,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.27,0:09:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能让你忘记地狱 - 真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you wouldn't remember hell. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.95,0:09:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.70,0:09:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远忘记 像病一样被治愈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For good? Like a cure?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.31,0:09:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是被治愈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not a cure. It…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.45,0:09:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说能持续一生\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said it could last a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.79,0:09:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 就这样玩弄我的性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. So, playing pretty fast and loose with my life here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.54,0:09:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吧 迪恩 - 我在努力救你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- don't you think, Dean? - I'm trying to save your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.55,0:09:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是 迪恩 这是我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly, Dean! It's my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.98,0:09:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的命 我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my life, it's my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.82,0:09:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的计划要是出了什么差错\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it sure as hell ain't your head that's gonna explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.68,0:09:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的脑袋反正不会爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}when this whole scheme of yours goes sideways!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.79,0:09:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是很好奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.64,0:09:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜 死亡骑士做这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I presume death's not doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.08,0:09:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是他良心发现吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}out of the goodness of his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.91,0:09:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用什么来做交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's your half of the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.43,0:09:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我没听清\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I didn't get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.09,0:09:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得戴一天他的戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to wear the ring for a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.24,0:10:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他干嘛要你这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell would he want you to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.44,0:10:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,想爽一把什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get his rocks off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.48,0:10:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 但我已经答应了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. But I'm doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.23,0:10:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.91,0:10:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听完了你的话 我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I hear you, all right? I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.67,0:10:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是需要一点时间来理理清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need a minute to wrap my head around it, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.89,0:10:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,找这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.55,0:10:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是出来走走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just taking a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.71,0:10:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.38,0:10:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.85,0:10:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你受到伤害的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna let you get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.34,0:10:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我清楚我在做什么 - 如果你错了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know what I'm doing here. - What if you're wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.46,0:10:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让这件事出任何差错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't let it go wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.70,0:10:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.45,0:10:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,「好吧」 那你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine? So, you're …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.53,0:10:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I'm trusting you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.93,0:10:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,勉强信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.87,0:10:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.72,0:10:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你大权在握\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one with the compass, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.83,0:11:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't mess it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.83,0:11:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.13,0:11:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.72,0:11:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是还要拿枪指着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, is this the part where you pull a gun on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.18,0:11:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把我锁在密室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and lock me in the panic room?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.31,0:11:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有这个必要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I have to?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.70,0:11:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.47,0:11:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想迪恩只是做他份内的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess Dean's got to do what he's got to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.88,0:11:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess we all do, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.34,0:11:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥披挂上阵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here goes everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.69,0:11:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这年头 随便一个傻小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll just let any slack-jawed haircut.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.26,0:11:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,都能当死亡骑士了\N{\fnArial\fs30}be Death these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.37,0:11:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天魅力四射啊 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're all charm today, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.99,0:12:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,话先说清楚 这样才能把麻烦降到最小\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's be clear so that we get through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.06,0:12:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好轻松完成任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a minimum of screw-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.53,0:12:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.82,0:12:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且现在我也不怎么喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And right now, I'm not crazy about you, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.95,0:12:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你老大的主意 不是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your boss' idea, not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.63,0:12:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但你绝对称得上是\N{\fnArial\fs30}True. But you have a long history.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.35,0:12:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,破坏大王了\N{\fnArial\fs30}of throwing a wrench in everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.98,0:12:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要遵守规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}so let's just stick to the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.31,0:12:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行吗 - 什么规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Deal? - And the rules are?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.43,0:12:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来的二十四小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the next 24 hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.33,0:12:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀死那些死期临近的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you kill everyone whose number's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.13,0:12:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我怎么知道什么人该… - 杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, how am I supposed to know who to… - Kill?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.72,0:12:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个名单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I have a list.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.08,0:12:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我看看 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me see. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.45,0:12:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你触碰他们 他们就会死 我来收魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You touch them, they die, I reap them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.04,0:12:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,清楚了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.81,0:12:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,清楚了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.09,0:12:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,取下戒指 你就输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remove the ring, you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.39,0:12:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,摸鱼打混 你也输\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slack off, you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.51,0:12:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听懂了吗 - 懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got it? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.95,0:12:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't mess this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.35,0:12:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能老给你擦屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my job to be your damn babysitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.52,0:13:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam…Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.19,0:13:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好不是什么烂事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This had better be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.10,0:13:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是你做过最愚蠢的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here's one for the list of dumbest things ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.51,0:13:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,召唤想杀你的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Summon the angel who wants to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.19,0:13:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常时期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Desperate times.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.96,0:13:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助 巴尔萨泽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help, Balthazar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.79,0:13:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.55,0:13:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上次相遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since last time we met,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想 想要什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}you wanted to … what was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.72,0:13:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,对对 油炸我的翅膀 要「爽脆」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, yes … fry my wings "extra crispy."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.73,0:13:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.35,0:13:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,误会的够深的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.45,0:13:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一点建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need some advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.79,0:13:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 建议 - 天使的建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Advice? - Angel advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.05,0:13:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那去问你的男朋友啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then go ask your boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.52,0:13:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡无法帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass can't help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.99,0:13:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有一种咒语或者武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to know if there's a spell or a weapon,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.35,0:14:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让灵魂永远脱离肉体\N{\fnArial\fs30}anything that can keep a soul out … forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.03,0:14:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.38,0:14:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.88,0:14:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.46,0:14:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,情节真是扑朔迷离\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plot thickens.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.47,0:14:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你的灵魂呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your soul, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.40,0:14:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊 不会还在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good god, no. It's not still…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.56,0:14:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.79,0:14:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥哥找到了拿回我灵魂的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother found a way to put it back in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.55,0:14:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.93,0:14:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.93,0:14:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不要 话说小米和小路正折磨它\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, 'cause Michael and Lucy are hate-banging it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.17,0:14:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,折磨得起劲呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.59,0:14:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你帮得了我吗 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you help me? - Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.96,0:14:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 我愿意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is, will I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.07,0:14:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,开个条件吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set your terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.23,0:14:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,无偿提供\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.55,0:14:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,免费\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.76,0:14:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.35,0:14:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看上去像个有为青年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you seem like a capable young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.74,0:14:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不介意你欠我点人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd love to have you in my debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.29,0:14:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,况且我必须承认 我对你哥可不怎么感冒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have to say, I'm not a fan of your brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.32,0:15:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到他抓狂一定令人愉悦\N{\fnArial\fs30}so screwing him would delight me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.72,0:15:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 说正事 咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, to business. The spell, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.81,0:15:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,材料倒是很好找\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, finding the ingredients are easy enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.74,0:15:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有一件比较棘手\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, uh, there's one tricky part, however.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.16,0:15:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.86,0:15:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要在你的皮囊上留下创伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to scar your vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.57,0:15:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.04,0:15:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要有东西玷污它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning something that so pollutes it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.63,0:15:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它不再适合灵魂居住\N{\fnArial\fs30}it renders it uninhabitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.40,0:15:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要非常特别的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calls for something very specific.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.03,0:15:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.84,0:15:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,弑父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patricide.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.63,0:15:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸已经死了很多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad's been dead for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.71,0:15:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,说白了 你需要你父亲的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be clear, um, you need the blood of your father,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.33,0:15:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不一定是亲生父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}but your father needn't be blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.66,0:15:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comprehended?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.66,0:15:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,事先声明 人们死时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just so you know, when people die,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.30,0:15:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很可能会问你问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}they might have questions for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.76,0:15:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是问你 问死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, not you, but death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.86,0:15:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean like,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.11,0:15:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么贝蒂·怀特（著名长寿演员）都比我活得长\N{\fnArial\fs30}"How did Betty White outlast me?"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.88,0:15:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,常见的是 这一切都算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}"What's it all mean?" is popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.12,0:15:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我会神奇地知道答案吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And am I just gonna magically know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.90,0:15:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.66,0:16:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我他妈的该怎么回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what the hell am I supposed to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.13,0:16:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 总得说点什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, give me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.21,0:16:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,忍忍吧 随机应变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suck it up. Comes with the gig.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.89,0:16:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,利索点 利索点 拿钱来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.79,0:16:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看不见 也听不见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't hear you. They can't see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.48,0:16:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一旁看着就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let this play out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.92,0:16:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要带走哪个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, who am I taking?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.24,0:16:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,静观其变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.31,0:16:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.25,0:16:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我毙了这小孩吗 速度点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to shoot the kid?! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.53,0:16:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我在开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you think I'm kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.08,0:16:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有柜台下面的抽屉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't forget the drawer under the register.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.39,0:16:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊 打开它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.81,0:16:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.56,0:16:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.90,0:16:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,想什么呢 动手啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Tick tock.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.75,0:16:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在痛苦难耐 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in agonizing pain, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.18,0:16:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.88,0:16:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,再等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.62,0:17:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.19,0:17:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,主要是因为你是个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mostly because you're a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.09,0:17:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,一路顺风 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy the ride down, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.07,0:17:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 有你受的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me … sauna gets hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.17,0:17:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没那么难嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.92,0:17:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我说 他貌似是要心脏病突发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me crazy, but this smells like a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.62,0:17:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真猜着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.56,0:18:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.89,0:18:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是奶酪太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think maybe it was the extra cheese?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.96,0:18:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 不过味道真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It was good, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.66,0:18:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是在附近买的吗 - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that a local place? - Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.33,0:18:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 该上路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Uh, time to go, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.44,0:18:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.33,0:18:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.34,0:18:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不可以告诉我这一切都算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you tell me what it all means?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.89,0:18:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都是浮云\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is dust in the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.28,0:18:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.08,0:18:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一句歌词儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Kansas song?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.54,0:18:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 他是新手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. He's new.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.92,0:19:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒来的时候你就不在了 你去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woke up and you were gone. Where you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.70,0:19:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去兜了兜风 没啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just driving around. No biggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.29,0:19:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喝吗 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Drink? - Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.28,0:19:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先请 老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.32,0:19:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是你 我们去加州时照的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's you when we went to California.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.93,0:19:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那会儿才六岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were 6 then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.29,0:19:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,天 这张怎么还留着啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God. We should burn that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.80,0:19:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,多可爱啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.53,0:19:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸还是孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dad or the kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.97,0:19:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.60,0:19:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 她才多大 十三岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. What is she, 13?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.81,0:19:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,十二\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.87,0:19:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这张呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's…?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.33,0:19:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your mom…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.94,0:19:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她像你这么大时照的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When she was your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.19,0:20:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还有别的家人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy have any other family?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.19,0:20:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.44,0:20:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太惨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.93,0:20:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你以为都是持枪抢劫犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you thought it was all gonna be armed robbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.12,0:20:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,和心脏病复发什么的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and heart attacks waiting to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.56,0:20:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她才十二岁 - 有严重的心脏病\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's 12! - With a serious heart condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.86,0:20:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's next on the list?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.01,0:20:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你必须带她走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you have to take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.24,0:20:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁说的 - 死亡骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Says who? - Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.65,0:20:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就是死亡骑士 - 你明白我的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm death. - You know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.38,0:20:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又是谁让他这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, who tells him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.42,0:20:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 一切本该如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. It just is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.14,0:20:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.40,0:20:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,歇歇吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.68,0:20:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这辈子都在和命运抗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've spent my whole life fighting that crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.54,0:20:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没有什么命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no such thing as destiny,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.10,0:20:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像根本没有世界末日一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like there was no apocalypse …
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.51,0:20:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是一堆狂妄的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a bunch of stuck-up mooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.86,0:20:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想让我们人类奴隶对他们质疑罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}who didn't want us human slaves asking questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.38,0:20:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让这小女孩活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I say the little girl lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.16,0:20:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道有趣之处在哪里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what's amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.47,0:20:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的这些连你自己都不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't actually buy a word you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.50,0:20:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 才没有 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, I do. - Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.23,0:20:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以每次你们干预那些生生死死的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, all the times that you messed with life and death,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.31,0:20:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果都很顺心是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}they just worked out for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.92,0:20:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次都像开沙滩派对一样欢乐 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just a beach party every time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.06,0:20:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I know this much …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.34,0:21:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是死亡骑士 她十二岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm death, she's 12,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.69,0:21:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她今天不会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she's not dying today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.83,0:21:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,从医学角度上 我解释不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medically, I can't explain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.03,0:21:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以她的心脏就痊愈了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So her heart just healed?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.30,0:21:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple of times in your career,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.51,0:21:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实会遇到一些事 只能称之为奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}you see something you just got to call a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.11,0:21:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道不需要动手术了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is I won't have to operate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.55,0:21:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢你 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Thank you, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.29,0:22:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做到了 你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it. You're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.13,0:22:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你猜怎么样 我要下班了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hon, guess what? I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.23,0:22:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 手术取消了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, surgery was canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.93,0:22:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 这里还有别的活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We have more work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.06,0:22:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 一会儿见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. See you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.88,0:22:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,对A\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pair of aces.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.85,0:22:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一杯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.89,0:22:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.26,0:22:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜还是老的辣 你还太嫩了小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}May have been born at night, boy, but it wasn't last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.62,0:22:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.34,0:23:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 咱可想清楚了再动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's not do anything hasty here, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.08,0:23:36.94,Title,0,0,0,0,,不用说「强尼来了哦」（《闪灵》中的台词）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say, "Here's Johnny."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.96,0:23:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须这样做 鲍比 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to do this, Bobby. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.31,0:23:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该把自己逼入绝境\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't have cornered yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.35,0:23:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.06,0:24:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,加固的钢芯钛踢板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reinforced steel core, titanium kick plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.93,0:24:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,惬意享受吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get comfy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.38,0:24:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想给我解释下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to explain what this is about?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.73,0:24:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.10,0:24:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,迫于无奈 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to do this, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.86,0:24:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你坑爹呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says who?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.83,0:24:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是迪恩把灵魂塞回我的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Dean shoves that soul back in me,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.43,0:24:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,想像下那会多可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}think how bad that could really be.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.68,0:24:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须阻止他 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't let it happen, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.05,0:24:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 我不想杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's not like I want to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.64,0:24:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直都对我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been nothing but good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.75,0:24:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…what,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.28,0:24:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟恶魔做了交易还是咋的\N{\fnArial\fs30}demon deal or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.58,0:24:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.10,0:24:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是在发昏 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're making a mistake, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.69,0:24:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想好好的活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.02,0:24:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩已经找了个妥善的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's got a way to make it safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.99,0:24:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 什么在我脑中制造屏障之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, what, some wall inside my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.66,0:24:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能屹立不倒 扯淡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}that maybe stays up? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.71,0:25:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那或许行得通\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it works …
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.81,0:25:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是行不通呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what if it doesn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.49,0:25:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩一点不在乎我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean doesn't care about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.66,0:25:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只关心他的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}He … he just cares about his little brother, Sammy,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.36,0:25:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在地狱里受罪小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}burning in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.13,0:25:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为了把那个人弄回来简直在所不惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll kill me to get that other guy back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.07,0:25:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.52,0:25:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这很可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how scary it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.12,0:25:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道什么更可怕吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what's scarier?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.29,0:25:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是现在的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.27,0:25:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你头脑不清醒 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not in your right head, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.88,0:25:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我们没的选\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not giving us much choice here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.43,0:25:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.87,0:25:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,操蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.75,0:25:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想在太岁爷头上动土\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't nobody killing me in my house but me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.84,0:26:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我虽不情愿 但必要时一样会炸了你的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to blow your legs out, boy, but I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.86,0:26:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是怎样 你现在跟我搞冷战啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what, you gonna give me the silent treatment now?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.00,0:26:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,来真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.61,0:26:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,真该死 我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it! I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.96,0:26:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.87,0:26:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,编号500 请到急诊室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code 500, E.R.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.82,0:26:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.71,0:26:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,脊柱挫伤 内出血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fractured spine, internal bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.39,0:26:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,在救护车上心脏病发作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had a heart attack in the ambulance.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.08,0:26:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欧文斯医生呢 - 他刚离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need Dr. Owens. - He just left.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.58,0:26:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,打给他 让他赶紧回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call Owens. Tell him to turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.28,0:26:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 血压多少 - 血压60/30\N{\fnArial\fs30}- BP? - BP's 60 over 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.43,0:26:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,注射一毫克青霉素V钾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push one milligram of vepen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.89,0:26:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 那是 - 你没带走那女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, that's… - You let the girl live.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.81,0:26:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,护士提早回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nurse goes home early,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.34,0:26:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了本不应该发生的车祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}gets in a crash she wouldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.81,0:27:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在她需要心脏外科医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she needs the heart surgeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.55,0:27:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.19,0:27:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早料到会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew this would happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.73,0:27:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.44,0:27:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道你引发了一连串事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just knew that you knocked over a domino.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.16,0:27:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油啊 约琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.10,0:27:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她心跳骤停了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's in cardiac arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.21,0:27:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 带她走 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take her. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.94,0:27:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.36,0:27:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她不在名单上\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not on the list!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.56,0:27:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有因必有果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you do has consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.45,0:27:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还想引起其它的连锁反应吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to set off another chain reaction?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.14,0:27:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也跟她毫无关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got nothing to do with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.94,0:27:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是糟糕 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, too bad, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.13,0:27:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你戴上了戒指 就认命的干活吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You put on the ring. Now do your damn job.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.70,0:27:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go. - Clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.69,0:27:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.39,0:27:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她快不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is not gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.62,0:27:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,心脏停跳 她快不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's crashing again. We're losing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.19,0:27:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,300伏 充电\N{\fnArial\fs30}300, charging.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.07,0:27:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备 - 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Clear! - Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.51,0:27:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有反应 - 那是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No response. - Is that…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.19,0:27:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是… - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Am I… - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.70,0:27:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.50,0:27:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.76,0:27:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,还很年轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}So young.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.19,0:27:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.81,0:27:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本应长命百岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, you were supposed to live for many decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.84,0:27:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,生孩子 抱孙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have kids, grandkids.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.93,0:28:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.16,0:28:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.85,0:28:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是因为你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.86,0:28:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 约琳 时候到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Jolene. It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.86,0:28:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.91,0:28:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.55,0:28:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪儿 我妻子在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she? Where's my wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.89,0:28:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.23,0:28:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.09,0:28:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.99,0:28:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.43,0:28:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次真正的假期吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A real vacation?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.89,0:28:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.01,0:28:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能带你去这家咖啡厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take you to this one cafe,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.15,0:29:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,带你看我在哪里遇见了你母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}show you where I met your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.63,0:29:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到发生在护士身上的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw what happened to the nurse.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.02,0:29:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,去带走那孩子吧 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go and kill that girl, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.42,0:29:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说的你都明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to tell you what you already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.72,0:29:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's disrupting the natural order.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.35,0:29:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是扰乱了自然秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}by being alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.40,0:29:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最清楚那意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You of all people know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.54,0:29:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的余生将在混乱与悲伤中度过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chaos and sadness will follow her for the rest of her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.63,0:29:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的方法我们试过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We tried it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.59,0:29:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.26,0:29:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.92,0:30:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧的 兄弟 靠边停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man, pull the car over.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.42,0:30:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然就搭上小命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna get yourself killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.67,0:30:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么呢 叫你靠边停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? Pull the damn car over!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.21,0:30:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.85,0:30:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快给我停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, stop the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.09,0:30:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑子糨糊了吧 停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?! Stop the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.07,0:30:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,管他娘的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.93,0:30:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鬼啊 - 踩刹车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aah! - Hit the brakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.62,0:31:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.50,0:31:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,苔莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tessa!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.37,0:31:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在吗 苔莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You there?! Tessa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.15,0:31:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.50,0:31:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆的事黄了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.86,0:31:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,高兴了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You happy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.21,0:31:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少你能把我瞬移回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Least you can do is zap my ass back home!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.43,0:31:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.03,0:32:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赌输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost the bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.62,0:32:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你弟弟深表遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.04,0:32:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.60,0:32:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪儿 迪恩 交易结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go where, Dean? We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.60,0:32:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we …
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.99,0:32:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束未完的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfinished business.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.13,0:32:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.45,0:32:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你摘下了戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took the ring off.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.82,0:32:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 我以为你想让这女孩逃过一劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, I thought you wanted the girl to skate by.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.02,0:32:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没人逃得过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one really skates by.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.50,0:32:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.57,0:33:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,该告别了 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should say your goodbyes, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.67,0:33:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.35,0:33:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定是打瞌睡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must have dozed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.19,0:33:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,希拉里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hilary?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.77,0:33:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.03,0:33:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.83,0:33:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没反应 没有脉搏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing, not getting a pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.96,0:33:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.95,0:33:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.45,0:33:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.79,0:33:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我爸爸怎么办 - 他会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But what about my dad? - He'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.55,0:33:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.51,0:33:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.44,0:33:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能丢下他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I can't just leave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.05,0:33:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太不公平了 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not fair! - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.38,0:33:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么还要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then why?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.35,0:33:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.02,0:33:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,万物皆有其秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's sort of a … a natural order to things.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.09,0:33:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,秩序什么的都是狗屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natural order is stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.27,0:33:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这么觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I agree with you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.23,0:34:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.24,0:34:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.95,0:34:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.87,0:34:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我像你亲爹一样待你 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been like a father to you, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.13,0:34:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你心里必须明白这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere inside, you've got to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.07,0:34:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 就这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's just it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.16,0:34:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.21,0:34:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 萨姆 我回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, sam. I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.31,0:35:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能一直这样 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't keep doing this, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.78,0:35:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是要我怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what am I,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.33,0:35:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次他要杀人的时候都把他捆起来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}gonna tie him up every time he tries to kill someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.41,0:35:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也困不住他 他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's not gonna hold him. I mean, he's …
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.02,0:35:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都做得出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capable of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.19,0:35:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I supposed to do here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.91,0:35:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.79,0:36:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.49,0:36:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.57,0:36:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你带了个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brought you one …
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.79,0:36:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,从洛杉矶那家有名的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From a little stand in Los Angeles.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.74,0:36:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,培根热狗店买的\N{\fnArial\fs30}known for their bacon dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.04,0:36:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.41,0:36:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,天 怎么吃上这么廉价的东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, what's with you and cheap food?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.45,0:36:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼此彼此啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could ask you the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.77,0:36:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,想在戴回戒指前先好好犒劳自己一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought I'd have a treat before I put the ring back on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.18,0:36:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,比你想象的难 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heavier than it looks, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.64,0:36:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候 你真的只想摆脱这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes, you just want the thing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.89,0:36:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也只能想想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.95,0:36:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不饿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.64,0:36:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.79,0:36:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你知道我失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you know that I flunked.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.09,0:37:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.81,0:37:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便提一下 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and by the way, I, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.57,0:37:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,干你的活儿 我糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sucked at being you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.77,0:37:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,把自然秩序什么的搞得一塌糊涂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really screwed up the whole natural order thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.20,0:37:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我相信你也已经知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm sure you knew about that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.77,0:37:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 如果时间倒流\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if you could go back,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.87,0:37:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会就直接杀了那个小女孩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}would you simply kill the little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.21,0:37:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再婆妈又傲娇\N{\fnArial\fs30}No fuss, no stomping your feet?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.54,0:37:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果知道是这么回事 我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knowing what I know now, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.52,0:37:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话还真让我吃惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm surprised to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.02,0:37:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有惊 也有喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprised and glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.66,0:37:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便吧 别太激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, don't get excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.74,0:37:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会救下那个护士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have saved the nurse, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.50,0:37:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.27,0:37:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想不光是这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's a little more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.75,0:37:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天 你见识到了生死之事如何运作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, you got a hard look behind the curtain.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.31,0:37:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,扰乱自然秩序可不好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrecking the natural order's not quite such fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.27,0:37:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其在你还要亲自承担后果的时候 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you have to mop up the mess, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.05,0:37:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对你来说很难 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is hard for you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.43,0:37:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你随便舍弃自己的性命 因为你觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You throw away your life because you've come to assume.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.98,0:37:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正还能捡回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it'll bounce right back into your lap.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.59,0:38:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但人的灵魂可不是橡皮球\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the human soul is not a rubber ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.92,0:38:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,它并不持久 还很脆弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's vulnerable, impermanent,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.94,0:38:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但却比你想象的强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}but stronger than you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.53,0:38:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,也远比你想象中的珍贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}And more valuable than you can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.32,0:38:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.46,0:38:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你今天学到了些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you've learned something today.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.74,0:38:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道我怎么想吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to know what I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.08,0:38:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你早料到我一天都坚持不下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you knew that I wouldn't last a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.37,0:38:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.56,0:38:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我输了 我认了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.26,0:38:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但至少我还有胆量承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}But at least I have the balls to admit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.17,0:38:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这从一开始就有猫腻儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it was rigged from the jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.35,0:38:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,多数人跟我说话的时候都会恭敬些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most people speak to me with more respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.84,0:38:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是那意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.38,0:38:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就说到这吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.23,0:38:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.48,0:38:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在我要回到地狱去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I'm going to go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.73,0:38:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿回你弟弟的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get your brother's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.70,0:39:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you do that for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.98,0:39:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't do it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.13,0:39:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你弟弟不断地复活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your brother keep coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.50,0:39:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的存在是宇宙平衡的奇耻大辱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an affront to the balance of the universe,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.90,0:39:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们造成了整个世界的混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you cause disruption on a global scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.60,0:39:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I apologize for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.06,0:39:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你还有用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have use.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.81,0:39:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你在调查某事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, you're digging at something.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.30,0:39:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,英勇无畏的大侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}The intrepid detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.34,0:39:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你继续调查 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to keep digging, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.98,0:39:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你不跟我说说明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're just gonna be cryptic, or…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.72,0:39:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事关灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about the souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.84,0:39:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,该明白的时候你会明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll understand when you need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.61,0:39:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait …
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.30,0:39:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.65,0:39:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,屏障那东西真的有用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is this wall thing really gonna work?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.38,0:39:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,75%的几率吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call it 75%.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.97,0:39:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.71,0:39:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.63,0:39:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.60,0:39:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.40,0:40:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.69,0:40:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.90,0:40:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.50,0:40:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将在你的意识里放入一个屏障\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna put up a barrier inside your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.68,0:40:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.88,0:40:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能会感到有些…痒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might feel a little…itchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.69,0:40:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但帮我个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}But do me a favor …
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.09,0:40:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要碰这个屏障\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't scratch the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.25,0:40:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because trust me …
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.53,0:40:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会喜欢那后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna like what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.21,0:40:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.32,0:40:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.72,0:40:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要 你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no! You don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.54,0:40:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道到底会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what'll happen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.18,0:40:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.60,0:40:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no…
